# examples/games/08_dungeon, played: the title, into the Crypt, a swing, the
# pause both ways, and then standing among the slimes of the hall until the
# crypt keeps you -- and down again.
#
# The arrows walk, Space strikes, Escape pauses. Nothing in the game is
# random but the sparks, and rmp::random is seeded. See tests/e2e/script.h for
# the grammar.

# The title's panel appears for 0.22 s, fourteen frames: the shot waits.
20 shot title
21 expect scene TitleScene
# Descend has the focus: Enter alone starts a run.
22 tap KEY_ENTER
22 expect scene LevelScene
60 shot crypt
# Into the hall, where the slimes are, and a swing at the first.
61 press KEY_RIGHT
170 release KEY_RIGHT
171 tap KEY_SPACE
175 shot swing
# The pause, by its key, both ways.
200 tap KEY_ESCAPE
200 expect scene PauseScene
230 shot pause
231 tap KEY_ESCAPE
232 expect scene LevelScene
# Standing still, the slimes and the bat do the rest.
330 shot hurt
560 shot fallen
560 expect scene EndScene
# Again has the focus.
562 tap KEY_ENTER
562 expect scene LevelScene
600 shot again
601 end
